---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Resume">
    <h1
        style="font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: #5f6368; margin-bottom: 3rem;"
    >
        Index / Resume
    </h1>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
        <div
            style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 2rem; flex-wrap: wrap; border-bottom: 1px solid #1f2023; padding-bottom: 1.5rem;"
        >
            <div>
                <h2
                    style="font-size: 2rem; margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0; color: #e8eaed;"
                >
                    DONG CHENG
                </h2>
                <p style="margin: 0; color: #9aa0a6; line-height: 1.8;">
                    Shanghai, China<br />
                    Senior iOS Engineer<br />
                    9+ years building consumer apps at scale
                </p>
            </div>

            <div style="display: flex; gap: 20px;">
                <a href="mailto:hihengd@gmail.com" class="social-link gmail">
                    <img
                        src="imgs/brands/gmail.svg"
                        width="18"
                        height="18"
                        alt="Gmail"
                    />
                </a>
                <a
                    href="https://www.github.com/imkdir"
                    target="_blank"
                    class="social-link github"
                >
                    <img
                        src="imgs/brands/github.svg"
                        width="18.35"
                        height="18"
                        alt="GitHub"
                    />
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
        <h3 class="section-title">Summary</h3>
        <p class="body-copy">
            Senior iOS Engineer with 9+ years of experience building and
            shipping consumer mobile applications at scale. Strong background in
            Swift, SwiftUI, UIKit, Objective-C, app architecture, performance
            optimization, networking, local persistence, and App Store delivery.
            Recently expanded into full-stack product development with React and
            AI-assisted workflows, building and deploying independent products
            end to end.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
        <h3 class="section-title">Skills</h3>
        <div class="skills-grid">
            <div>
                <div class="label">Mobile</div>
                <p class="meta-copy">
                    Swift, SwiftUI, UIKit, Objective-C, Core Data, Core
                    Graphics, RxSwift, IGListKit, Texture
                </p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="label">Frontend / Full-Stack</div>
                <p class="meta-copy">
                    React, JavaScript, TypeScript, Node.js, Express, SQLite
                </p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="label">Tools / Workflow</div>
                <p class="meta-copy">Xcode, Git, Zed, Codex, Gemini</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="label">Other</div>
                <p class="meta-copy">
                    App Store release management, performance optimization,
                    debugging, documentation
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
        <h3 class="section-title">Professional Experience</h3>

        <article class="entry">
            <div class="entry-header">
                <div>
                    <h4 class="entry-title">
                        <a
                            href="https://glowing.com/"
                            target="_blank"
                            rel="noopener noreferrer">Glow</a
                        >
                    </h4>
                    <div class="entry-subtitle">
                        iOS Engineer · Shanghai, China
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="entry-date">Nov 2019 – Nov 2025</div>
            </div>

            <ul class="entry-list">
                <li>
                    Built and maintained core features across multiple iOS apps
                    in the Glow ecosystem, supporting a large global consumer
                    user base and shipping production features at scale.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Developed internal debugging tools that improved engineering
                    efficiency and streamlined team collaboration.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Improved app performance and stability in areas such as
                    scrolling smoothness, crash reduction, and architecture
                    consistency, including building reusable internal frameworks
                    such as <a
                        href="https://github.com/imkdir/Ark"
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer">Ark</a
                    >.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Managed App Store release workflows, including submission,
                    release monitoring, and coordination across teams.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Collaborated with product, design, QA, and backend teams to
                    define requirements, deliver features, and iterate on user
                    feedback in a fast-paced environment.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Mentored junior engineers, contributed to code reviews, and
                    helped improve engineering practices by introducing reusable
                    MVVM-based architecture across projects.
                </li>
            </ul>

            <div class="subsection-label">Apps / product areas worked on</div>
            <ul class="entry-list compact">
                <li>
                    <strong
                        ><a
                            href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/glow-ovulation-period-app/id638021335"
                            target="_blank"
                            rel="noopener noreferrer"
                            >Glow Ovulation &amp; Period Tracker</a
                        ></strong
                    > — worked on major feature iterations including timeline and
                    chart experiences, as well as bug fixes and performance enhancements.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong
                        ><a
                            href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/glow-baby-tracker-growth-app/id1077177456"
                            target="_blank"
                            rel="noopener noreferrer">Glow Baby Tracker</a
                        ></strong
                    > — contributed to feature development, maintenance, and performance
                    improvements for parenting-focused user workflows.
                </li>
            </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="entry">
            <div class="entry-header">
                <div>
                    <h4 class="entry-title">
                        <a
                            href="https://www.nonda.co/"
                            target="_blank"
                            rel="noopener noreferrer">nonda</a
                        >
                    </h4>
                    <div class="entry-subtitle">
                        iOS Engineer · Shanghai, China
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="entry-date">Oct 2016 – Aug 2018</div>
            </div>

            <ul class="entry-list">
                <li>
                    Developed and shipped native iOS features in Swift for
                    CoreBluetooth-powered applications, including work related
                    to <a
                        href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/zus-save-car-expenses/id1038723291"
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer">ZUS</a
                    >.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Built an Auto Layout framework, <a
                        href="https://github.com/imkdir/Ariel"
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer">Ariel</a
                    >, to reduce boilerplate code and improve maintainability
                    and development speed.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Integrated RxSwift with MVVM architecture to bind BLE data
                    streams to the UI in a clean, reactive workflow.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Participated in code reviews, debugging, release support,
                    and collaboration with designers and backend engineers.
                </li>
            </ul>
        </article>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
        <h3 class="section-title">Selected Independent Projects</h3>

        <article class="entry">
            <div class="entry-header">
                <div>
                    <h4 class="entry-title">
                        <a
                            href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/nihilo/id6757951351"
                            target="_blank"
                            rel="noopener noreferrer">nihilo</a
                        >
                    </h4>
                    <div class="entry-subtitle">SwiftUI</div>
                </div>
                <div class="entry-date">2026</div>
            </div>

            <ul class="entry-list">
                <li>
                    Built a native weight-loss tracking app based on an idea
                    first validated in spreadsheets.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Designed and shipped the product independently from concept
                    to App Store release.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Used AI-assisted development tools such as Gemini in Xcode
                    for prototyping, debugging, refactoring, and UI iteration.
                </li>
            </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="entry">
            <div class="entry-header">
                <div>
                    <h4 class="entry-title">
                        <a
                            href="https://imkdiread.com"
                            target="_blank"
                            title="plato is the invitation code"
                            rel="noopener noreferrer">imkdiread.com</a
                        >
                    </h4>
                    <div class="entry-subtitle">
                        React, Node.js, Express, SQLite, Gemini API,
                        DigitalOcean
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="entry-date">2026</div>
            </div>

            <ul class="entry-list">
                <li>
                    Built a full-stack, AI-powered PDF reading companion and
                    Zettelkasten workspace for organizing book highlights.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Engineered a context-aware LLM routing system with dynamic
                    anchor prompts to reduce context drift in long AI chats.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Owned end-to-end development, from designing the SQLite
                    database and REST API to deploying the monolithic
                    architecture on a VPS.
                </li>
            </ul>
        </article>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
        <h3 class="section-title">Education</h3>
        <article
            class="entry"
            style="margin-bottom: 0; padding-bottom: 0; border-bottom: 0;"
        >
            <div class="entry-header">
                <div>
                    <h4 class="entry-title">Qingdao University</h4>
                    <div class="entry-subtitle">
                        Bachelor of Engineering in Digital Media Technology
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="entry-date">2015</div>
            </div>
        </article>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h3 class="section-title">Languages</h3>
        <p class="body-copy">
            Chinese (Native) · English (Professional working proficiency)
        </p>
    </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
    .section-title {
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.2em;
        color: #5f6368;
        margin: 0 0 1.25rem 0;
    }

    .body-copy {
        color: #e8eaed;
        line-height: 1.8;
        font-size: 1rem;
        margin: 0;
        max-width: 720px;
    }

    .meta-copy {
        color: #9aa0a6;
        line-height: 1.8;
        margin: 0;
    }

    .skills-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 1.25rem 2rem;
    }

    .label {
        color: #e8eaed;
        margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
        font-weight: 700;
    }

    .entry {
        padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #1f2023;
    }

    .entry-header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 1rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .entry-title {
        margin: 0;
        color: #e8eaed;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .entry-subtitle {
        color: #9aa0a6;
        margin-top: 0.25rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .entry-date {
        color: #5f6368;
        white-space: nowrap;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        padding-top: 0.1rem;
    }

    .entry-list {
        margin: 0;
        padding-left: 1.25rem;
        color: #e8eaed;
        line-height: 1.75;
    }

    .entry-list li + li {
        margin-top: 0.5rem;
    }

    .entry-list.compact {
        margin-top: 0.4rem;
    }

    .subsection-label {
        color: #5f6368;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.16em;
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        margin: 1.1rem 0 0.5rem 0;
    }

    @media (max-width: 720px) {
        .skills-grid {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .entry-header {
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.35rem;
        }

        .entry-date {
            white-space: normal;
            padding-top: 0;
        }
    }

    .entry-title a,
    .entry-list a {
        color: inherit;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
        transition:
            border-color 0.2s ease,
            color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .entry-title a:hover,
    .entry-list a:hover {
        border-bottom-color: #5f6368;
        color: #e8eaed;
    }

    .entry-title a:visited,
    .entry-list a:visited {
        color: inherit;
    }
</style>
